WEBVTT

01:23.330 --> 01:28.789
[A Splendid Match]

01:29.460 --> 01:31.730
[Episode 39]

02:13.000 --> 02:13.970
Come on!

03:02.870 --> 03:04.470
My reinforcements are here.

03:05.400 --> 03:06.950
You're finished!

03:20.400 --> 03:22.400
Light the fire!

03:50.520 --> 03:51.630
Kill!

03:51.890 --> 03:53.120
Kill!

03:53.240 --> 03:54.320
Kill!

03:54.340 --> 03:55.810
Kill!

03:55.840 --> 03:56.829
Kill!

03:56.910 --> 03:58.900
Kill!

03:59.840 --> 04:01.630
Kill!

04:03.680 --> 04:05.440
Kill!

04:06.280 --> 04:08.650
-Kill!
-Kill!

04:08.710 --> 04:12.240
-Kill!
-Kill!

04:21.230 --> 04:22.890
Great Yan's reinforcements?

05:02.350 --> 05:03.820
Third Master!

06:02.510 --> 06:03.630
Kill!

06:03.650 --> 06:06.160
Kill!

07:31.460 --> 07:34.920
[Ye]

07:55.790 --> 07:59.010
[Ye]

08:37.419 --> 08:44.100
[Ye]

08:58.410 --> 09:00.320
[Ye]

09:25.120 --> 09:25.790
His Majesty can be surrounded

09:25.790 --> 09:26.960
by loyal men,

09:28.240 --> 09:29.840
or by treacherous villains,

09:31.390 --> 09:32.750
but there is no place

09:33.670 --> 09:35.370
for someone like you.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.000
What kind of man am I?

09:39.360 --> 09:40.440
You're

09:41.960 --> 09:43.170
a man in despair.

10:39.150 --> 10:41.400
[Ye]

11:02.280 --> 11:05.050
[Ye]

14:27.270 --> 14:30.570
♪ Moonlight spills over the lapels of
my gown ♪

14:30.270 --> 14:31.070
Third Master.

14:33.980 --> 14:38.320
♪ My longing receives no reply ♪

14:40.330 --> 14:45.420
♪ Wind rises, silently dissipating
from my heart ♪

14:48.760 --> 14:54.290
♪ That is the morning I missed ♪

14:56.650 --> 15:00.420
♪ Ink stains spread on the letter paper ♪

15:01.410 --> 15:03.140
You shouldn't call me that.

15:03.950 --> 15:05.380
Xian is your cousin,

15:03.970 --> 15:07.550
♪ Outlining an unfinished poem ♪

15:05.960 --> 15:07.360
but he is my blood nephew.

15:08.000 --> 15:09.460
You should follow his lead

15:09.920 --> 15:15.500
♪ Lamplight gently flickers
at the corners of my eyes ♪

15:10.270 --> 15:11.360
and call me Uncle.

15:14.070 --> 15:15.470
Taking advantage of me

15:16.030 --> 15:17.150
is not that easy.

15:18.150 --> 15:23.200
♪ Reflecting the empty memories ♪

15:20.360 --> 15:21.360
I think your looks

15:22.480 --> 15:23.950
are the only face you have left.

15:23.950 --> 15:27.770
♪ I gently murmur your name ♪

15:24.270 --> 15:26.000
Otherwise, with your awful attitude,

15:26.000 --> 15:27.530
who would want to marry you?

15:28.390 --> 15:29.320
What is going on here?

15:28.500 --> 15:31.350
♪ Like snowflakes falling into the palm ♪

15:30.600 --> 15:31.660
What are you doing?

15:32.200 --> 15:35.040
♪ Before I can hold them up
for you to see clearly ♪

15:32.390 --> 15:33.990
Keep your hands to yourself.

15:34.270 --> 15:35.390
If I'm making things up,

15:35.390 --> 15:36.310
may I be struck by lightning.

15:35.880 --> 15:38.440
♪ They have already melted into teardrops
falling into my hands ♪

15:37.030 --> 15:38.150
And if you're lying,

15:38.150 --> 15:39.350
may it strike you too.

15:39.560 --> 15:42.500
♪ I gently write of parting ♪

15:40.030 --> 15:41.130
Meeting you

15:41.200 --> 15:43.240
already feels like
being struck by lightning.

15:43.240 --> 15:45.200
Gu Jinzhao, how dare you!

15:43.560 --> 15:46.710
♪ Like fleeting fireflies
losing their trace ♪

15:47.630 --> 15:49.590
♪ Before I can inscribe the ending ♪

15:50.450 --> 15:53.740
♪ It was already destined, in this life,
hard to promise each other ♪

15:52.750 --> 15:54.410
Do you really not understand,

15:54.440 --> 15:55.700
or are you pretending?

15:56.360 --> 15:57.280
I did this

15:57.670 --> 15:58.670
for you.

15:58.480 --> 16:01.150
♪ Worries have built a gate
within my heart ♪

16:02.460 --> 16:05.000
♪ Yet the oath will not succumb ♪

16:04.510 --> 16:05.970
Your mother was murdered.

16:06.170 --> 16:08.120
♪ In dreams, I piece together
the lingering warmth ♪

16:06.830 --> 16:07.700
Who did it?

16:08.150 --> 16:09.250
I'll help you kill them.

16:09.250 --> 16:11.400
♪ Whose kiss does the deep love trap? ♪

16:10.910 --> 16:12.360
You have so many carriages,

16:12.360 --> 16:13.360
but so few guards,

16:13.540 --> 16:16.000
♪ The chessboard, black and white pieces
like stars ♪

16:14.120 --> 16:15.730
you'll be an obvious target.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.120
With them escorting you,

16:17.160 --> 16:19.780
♪ I play alone until dawn breaks ♪

16:19.000 --> 16:20.260
I'll feel more at ease.

16:20.790 --> 16:23.060
♪ This single move has trapped time ♪

16:23.550 --> 16:24.370
What is this?

16:23.950 --> 16:26.470
♪ And trapped me as well ♪

16:24.960 --> 16:25.890
It's a bracelet.

16:27.510 --> 16:29.200
It was confiscated from a seized property.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.670
It's already been accounted for.

16:30.670 --> 16:32.330
You can wear it without worry.

16:32.820 --> 16:34.150
If you think it's dirty,

16:34.360 --> 16:35.420
just throw it away.

16:40.190 --> 16:41.540
Gu Jinzhao!

16:52.950 --> 16:54.080
What a coincidence,

16:54.530 --> 16:56.400
running into you here of all places.

16:56.400 --> 16:59.990
♪ I gently murmur your name ♪

17:00.800 --> 17:03.920
♪ Like snowflakes falling into the palm ♪

17:04.490 --> 17:07.180
♪ Before I can hold them up
for you to see clearly ♪

17:07.839 --> 17:10.760
♪ They have already melted into teardrops
falling into my hands ♪

17:11.599 --> 17:14.780
♪ I gently write of parting ♪

17:15.510 --> 17:18.960
♪ Like fleeting fireflies
losing their trace ♪

17:19.670 --> 17:22.020
♪ Before I can inscribe the ending ♪

17:22.530 --> 17:26.250
♪ We were destined never to be together ♪

17:27.220 --> 17:29.630
♪ The long night stretches
beyond the street ♪

17:30.490 --> 17:32.920
♪ Longing piles up like snowdrifts ♪

17:33.720 --> 17:36.550
♪ I gaze at the moon, praying
for a dream ♪

17:37.650 --> 17:40.420
♪ In the dream, your footsteps are light ♪

17:41.040 --> 17:44.280
♪ Softly, I gaze at that silhouette ♪

17:45.200 --> 17:48.230
♪ Like the sunset sinking
behind distant ridges ♪

17:49.480 --> 17:51.400
♪ Using all the strength of my
remaining years ♪

17:52.190 --> 17:56.700
♪ I could not hold you back
to say goodbye ♪

17:59.670 --> 18:02.780
♪ Gently, I sigh at that scene ♪

18:03.570 --> 18:06.720
♪ Like a swing still in an empty
courtyard ♪

18:08.090 --> 18:11.310
♪ Before I can grasp the past tightly ♪

18:14.270 --> 18:21.940
♪ Only memories remain, drifting lightly ♪

18:17.720 --> 18:18.520
Third Master.

18:37.270 --> 18:38.400
How is Third Master?

18:40.240 --> 18:41.080
Don't worry.

18:41.880 --> 18:42.740
He just woke up.

18:43.240 --> 18:43.860
He's fine.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.400
Stay with him for a while.

19:25.180 --> 19:30.440
[To Gu Jinzhao]

19:30.440 --> 19:31.700
[To my Esteemed Elder Sister, Mrs. Gu]

19:34.670 --> 19:37.050
[Before the Beiman people are defeated,
I shall pledge my life to the nation]

19:37.070 --> 19:39.110
[To my Esteemed Elder Sister, Mrs. Gu]

19:39.140 --> 19:40.010
[To Gu Jinzhao]

19:48.110 --> 19:48.770
Gu Jinzhao,

19:49.480 --> 19:51.210
if you are reading this letter,

19:51.510 --> 19:53.240
there is only one possibility:

19:53.920 --> 19:56.120
things have gone terribly wrong for me.

19:58.440 --> 20:00.100
You do not need to feel guilty.

20:00.680 --> 20:01.940
This trip to the border

20:02.200 --> 20:02.960
was for you,

20:03.720 --> 20:05.180
but it was also for myself.

20:06.920 --> 20:08.580
The physician told me long ago

20:09.030 --> 20:10.630
that my heart condition is severe,

20:10.630 --> 20:12.720
and I have less than three years to live.

20:12.720 --> 20:14.000
Instead of dying a meaningless death,

20:14.000 --> 20:15.770
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

20:15.160 --> 20:16.440
I would rather live a glorious life.

20:16.390 --> 20:19.620
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

20:17.720 --> 20:18.400
In the past,

20:18.920 --> 20:21.680
my father always scolded me
for being unable to learn martial arts,

20:21.680 --> 20:22.500
unable to lead troops,

20:21.780 --> 20:23.340
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

20:22.590 --> 20:24.560
and unable to uphold
the honor of the Marquis family.

20:23.910 --> 20:27.070
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

20:25.750 --> 20:26.640
But this time,

20:27.400 --> 20:28.400
I have led troops,

20:28.960 --> 20:29.590
I have fought the battles,

20:29.440 --> 20:30.980
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

20:30.680 --> 20:32.130
and I return wrapped in a horse's hide,

20:32.130 --> 20:35.200
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

20:32.640 --> 20:34.440
having died on the battlefield.

20:34.510 --> 20:36.160
When I meet him in the underworld,

20:36.160 --> 20:37.310
I will be able to straighten my back,

20:36.230 --> 20:42.570
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart ♪

20:38.310 --> 20:39.510
and tell him proudly:

20:39.720 --> 20:40.350
I, Ye Xian,

20:40.880 --> 20:43.010
have not disgraced the Ye family name.

20:43.280 --> 20:46.300
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

20:44.880 --> 20:45.740
Are you crying?

20:46.480 --> 20:47.440
Please don't.

20:47.140 --> 20:50.270
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

20:47.880 --> 20:49.340
You should be happy for me.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.160
As for regrets,

20:50.900 --> 20:54.150
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

20:52.270 --> 20:53.800
I won't pretend I have none.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.480
My mother is still alive,

20:55.110 --> 20:57.510
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

20:56.440 --> 20:58.570
but I can't be there to take care of her.

20:58.790 --> 21:01.950
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

20:58.880 --> 21:00.540
Please take care of her for me.

21:01.830 --> 21:02.870
And then there is my sister.

21:02.870 --> 21:05.760
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

21:03.240 --> 21:05.300
Her husband is useless, and my sister

21:05.820 --> 21:06.930
is too proud to show weakness.

21:06.600 --> 21:13.770
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

21:08.640 --> 21:09.240
She keeps

21:09.240 --> 21:10.640
all her tears to herself.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.290
She is very fond of you,

21:12.510 --> 21:14.030
so please visit her often.

21:16.440 --> 21:18.680
Then there is Xue Qinglan.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.680
She's a good lady,

21:21.510 --> 21:23.030
but unfortunately, she fell for me.

21:23.030 --> 21:24.760
Clearly she was a little silly.

21:26.480 --> 21:27.740
When she gets married,

21:27.960 --> 21:29.960
give her a wedding gift on my behalf.

21:30.400 --> 21:30.830
Right,

21:31.350 --> 21:33.010
♪ We once drank to talk of love and hate ♪

21:31.790 --> 21:32.440
and Baopu.

21:33.070 --> 21:34.400
It's a lovely cat,

21:34.250 --> 21:36.630
♪ But we fell into
the deep ditch of rumors ♪

21:35.770 --> 21:37.570
yet I have never once praised it.

21:39.230 --> 21:40.810
♪ Meeting and parting were like
moves on a chessboard ♪

21:39.590 --> 21:40.240
From now on,

21:40.240 --> 21:41.360
please compliment it more for me.

21:41.360 --> 21:44.440
♪ Every heartfelt word ended as a fault ♪

21:42.590 --> 21:43.790
As for Chen Yanyun,

21:45.960 --> 21:46.980
that insufferable man—

21:46.900 --> 21:48.440
♪ Seen the sun rise and the moon set ♪

21:47.110 --> 21:48.970
he always beats me at everything.

21:49.650 --> 21:52.470
♪ Only sigh that we are no longer
on the same path ♪

21:50.160 --> 21:52.360
He has even stolen your heart in secret.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.450
I'll never forgive him for that.

21:53.450 --> 22:00.140
♪ One wrong choice drove
my old friend away like a drifting bird ♪

21:55.310 --> 21:56.510
They say good people die young,

21:56.510 --> 21:58.770
while scoundrels live a thousand years.

21:59.550 --> 22:00.310
Given Chen Yanyun's situation

22:00.310 --> 22:01.680
and all his schemes,

22:00.760 --> 22:04.010
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

22:02.790 --> 22:04.600
he'll probably live long enough
to grow old with you.

22:04.600 --> 22:07.150
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

22:05.270 --> 22:06.160
In that case,

22:07.000 --> 22:08.340
at least he'll have done
one decent thing in his life.

22:08.340 --> 22:11.470
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

22:08.350 --> 22:08.960
However,

22:09.200 --> 22:10.730
if I die in battle this time,

22:11.240 --> 22:12.070
you'll never

22:12.090 --> 22:13.030
be able to forget me.

22:12.600 --> 22:14.880
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

22:14.240 --> 22:15.240
To remain

22:15.240 --> 22:16.460
in your heart this way—

22:16.460 --> 22:19.460
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

22:17.160 --> 22:19.360
I suppose I've finally beaten him once.

22:20.270 --> 22:23.390
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

22:20.720 --> 22:22.850
Just thinking about it makes me happy.

22:23.240 --> 22:23.590
You must make sure

22:23.590 --> 22:24.640
to tell him that part.

22:24.160 --> 22:31.160
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

22:25.070 --> 22:26.070
Bear this in mind.

22:29.790 --> 22:30.240
Right.

22:30.750 --> 22:31.290
Also,

22:31.750 --> 22:32.720
if I die,

22:33.030 --> 22:34.630
keep using the Ye Army's name

22:35.000 --> 22:36.460
for as long as it helps you.

22:37.550 --> 22:39.750
It's a pity about the military merit...

22:40.270 --> 22:40.930
Never mind.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.650
Consider it my parting gift to him.

22:44.000 --> 22:44.530
Alright,

22:45.270 --> 22:46.470
I'll leave it at that.

22:47.250 --> 22:50.500
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

22:48.200 --> 22:49.200
I will go on ahead.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.640
Meeting you in this life

22:50.950 --> 22:53.790
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

22:53.000 --> 22:55.000
was the greatest fortune of my life.

22:55.070 --> 22:58.120
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

22:57.360 --> 22:57.970
Take care.

22:58.790 --> 22:59.350
Take care.

22:58.910 --> 23:01.340
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

23:03.080 --> 23:05.880
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

23:06.560 --> 23:09.830
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

23:10.480 --> 23:16.530
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

23:18.370 --> 23:27.900
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

23:37.640 --> 23:41.050
[Ye]

23:47.790 --> 23:48.810
This time,

23:48.880 --> 23:50.420
I led 2,000 light cavalry,

23:50.750 --> 23:52.720
marching day and night without rest,

23:52.720 --> 23:54.380
yet I was still a step too late.

23:54.510 --> 23:55.170
Otherwise,

23:56.000 --> 23:57.730
Young Lord Ye would not have...

24:01.640 --> 24:02.550
But this time,

24:03.000 --> 24:06.130
I will absolutely escort you back
to the capital safely.

24:16.790 --> 24:17.640
I do not

24:18.240 --> 24:19.700
intend to return just yet.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.740
Before I came,

24:21.960 --> 24:23.790
His Lordship repeatedly instructed

24:23.790 --> 24:24.880
that I must personally

24:24.880 --> 24:27.010
escort you back to the capital safely.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.450
Are you worried

24:28.640 --> 24:29.840
that once you return,

24:30.060 --> 24:31.860
Fu Hailian will act against you?

24:33.590 --> 24:35.400
I'm not worried about myself.

24:37.060 --> 24:37.770
Right now,

24:38.480 --> 24:40.720
Shicheng and Menyuan have already fallen.

24:40.720 --> 24:43.510
Although Yi County
is guarded by 10,000 elite troops,

24:43.510 --> 24:44.510
the Beiman people are still

24:44.510 --> 24:46.570
continuously massing their forces.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.650
The Imperial Court

24:48.120 --> 24:48.880
must immediately dispatch

24:48.880 --> 24:50.790
the elite forces of the Capital Garrison

24:50.790 --> 24:52.720
to Yi County to confront the enemy.

24:53.110 --> 24:54.910
But these military deployments

24:55.590 --> 24:56.920
require the Grand Secretariat

24:56.920 --> 24:58.450
to coordinate and mediate.

24:59.200 --> 25:00.590
It requires the entire court to

25:00.590 --> 25:02.920
work together to carry them out smoothly.

25:03.880 --> 25:05.540
If I return to the capital now,

25:07.480 --> 25:08.880
the fact that my mentor

25:10.440 --> 25:11.830
is colluding with the Chunyuan Sect

25:11.830 --> 25:13.430
will inevitably be exposed.

25:14.000 --> 25:14.790
By then,

25:17.160 --> 25:19.420
the court will surely fall into turmoil.

25:21.030 --> 25:22.510
Let alone focusing on fighting the enemy,

25:22.510 --> 25:23.200
even

25:23.550 --> 25:24.680
dispatching troops

25:25.640 --> 25:26.590
might be delayed

25:27.200 --> 25:28.730
due to the turmoil at court,

25:28.920 --> 25:31.180
making it impossible to proceed in time.

25:32.310 --> 25:32.790
Just go back

25:32.790 --> 25:34.390
and report this to Yanzhang.

25:34.400 --> 25:35.800
He won't blame you for it.

25:36.720 --> 25:38.350
You civil officials are always like this!

25:38.350 --> 25:39.680
What should we do, then?

25:43.920 --> 25:44.920
Unless...

25:47.030 --> 25:48.310
I truly die.

25:56.330 --> 25:59.690
[Yongding Gate]

26:38.860 --> 26:39.590
Mother.

26:39.750 --> 26:40.920
Mother insisted on coming over.

26:40.920 --> 26:42.120
We couldn't stop her.

27:18.210 --> 27:19.160
Mother.

27:21.070 --> 27:23.000
It's not safe to stay here for long.

27:23.200 --> 27:23.920
We should

27:23.920 --> 27:25.520
return to the mansion first.

27:28.880 --> 27:29.440
Let's go.

27:29.680 --> 27:30.460
Mother.

28:40.880 --> 28:42.110
Jiuheng.

28:44.000 --> 28:46.240
You sacrificed your life for the country.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.390
I was devastated

28:47.790 --> 28:49.350
when I heard the news.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.400
Madam, please bring

28:56.350 --> 28:57.920
Jiuheng's coffin

28:58.830 --> 29:01.100
to Xuanmiao Temple

29:01.640 --> 29:03.900
so the officials may pay their respects.

29:06.550 --> 29:07.970
What if I refuse?

29:20.230 --> 29:22.030
I'm afraid that is not an option.

29:26.260 --> 29:27.300
Then I refuse.

29:28.700 --> 29:29.730
How dare you!

29:30.720 --> 29:31.800
I don't believe

29:32.720 --> 29:34.780
you would risk public condemnation

29:35.510 --> 29:37.110
by driving a loyal minister's

29:37.110 --> 29:38.970
widow to death in broad daylight!

30:03.710 --> 30:06.290
And I don't believe you truly want to die.

30:10.270 --> 30:11.930
I advise you not to provoke me.

30:12.680 --> 30:14.450
Third Master died in battle.

30:15.070 --> 30:16.870
His death was tragic and brutal.

30:16.880 --> 30:18.270
As his wife,

30:19.750 --> 30:21.400
why should I fear death?

30:58.880 --> 30:59.720
Let's go.

31:17.440 --> 31:18.570
Back to the mansion!

32:14.240 --> 32:15.040
Third Master.

32:15.720 --> 32:16.750
Madam should be

32:17.070 --> 32:18.800
arriving in the capital by now.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.440
By my calculations,

32:23.720 --> 32:25.580
she should have arrived already.

32:30.270 --> 32:31.480
I wonder if Madam

32:32.680 --> 32:34.550
will be able to bring reinforcements.

32:34.550 --> 32:35.400
I am

32:36.200 --> 32:37.240
a little worried.

32:43.750 --> 32:45.550
Madam can definitely find a way.

32:46.160 --> 32:47.680
I believe she can do it.

33:24.840 --> 33:26.500
I can tell you're distracted.

33:26.800 --> 33:27.890
Are you tired?

33:28.960 --> 33:30.620
Let me give you a shoulder rub.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.500
I used to do this

33:33.200 --> 33:34.860
for Grandmother all the time.

33:35.880 --> 33:36.740
I was wondering

33:38.200 --> 33:39.530
if there's any way

33:41.400 --> 33:41.960
to stop you

33:41.960 --> 33:43.560
from taking such a huge risk.

33:44.270 --> 33:45.270
What risk?

33:46.510 --> 33:48.170
I'm returning to the capital.

33:49.510 --> 33:51.200
Surely you don't truly believe

33:51.200 --> 33:53.160
that Fu Hailian can eat me alive?

33:55.880 --> 33:57.410
I'm only worried about you.

34:01.480 --> 34:03.280
You don't need to worry about me.

34:04.480 --> 34:05.270
Yi County's walls are high—

34:05.270 --> 34:06.550
easy to defend, hard to attack.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.410
Half a year ago,

34:07.550 --> 34:09.080
the walls were reinforced.

34:09.190 --> 34:11.449
Beiman people don't know siege warfare.

34:12.360 --> 34:13.360
In the short term,

34:14.550 --> 34:16.409
there's nothing they can do to me.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.960
By that logic,

34:21.030 --> 34:23.070
both of us are perfectly safe.

34:32.440 --> 34:33.300
This is for you.

34:36.960 --> 34:37.690
What is this?

34:38.630 --> 34:39.590
Qingpu brought this

34:39.590 --> 34:40.960
from Pingyang.

34:42.360 --> 34:43.550
Since I'm returning to the capital,

34:43.550 --> 34:44.750
I won't be needing it.

34:45.630 --> 34:46.830
Whenever you miss me,

34:46.880 --> 34:47.760
you can eat one.

34:57.710 --> 34:58.770
How many are there?

34:59.160 --> 34:59.890
Take a guess.

35:01.400 --> 35:02.400
Judging by touch,

35:04.960 --> 35:05.800
I think I could finish them

35:05.800 --> 35:06.800
within two hours.

35:10.800 --> 35:11.480
Don't you have

35:11.480 --> 35:12.610
anything to give me?

35:14.590 --> 35:16.450
Behind the painting in the study,

35:16.960 --> 35:18.000
there is a box.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.510
Inside it

35:19.510 --> 35:21.240
are the things I treasure most.

35:23.670 --> 35:24.440
If I...

35:28.800 --> 35:30.660
You can just keep it as a keepsake.

35:32.670 --> 35:34.280
What nonsense are you talking about?

35:34.280 --> 35:35.140
What keepsake?

35:36.030 --> 35:36.890
I only want you.

35:38.110 --> 35:39.170
Do you understand?

35:45.110 --> 35:45.910
I understand.

35:49.030 --> 35:49.960
Wait for me.

35:51.960 --> 35:53.490
I will definitely find a way

35:53.670 --> 35:55.870
to make the Imperial Court send troops.

35:56.400 --> 35:58.060
Sending troops is important,

35:59.440 --> 36:00.480
but to me,

36:04.590 --> 36:06.150
your safety matters more.

36:09.230 --> 36:11.090
In this lifetime, I, Chen Yanyun,

36:11.960 --> 36:13.560
have always placed the court

36:14.280 --> 36:15.400
and the nation

36:15.400 --> 36:17.110
above everything else.

36:19.670 --> 36:20.800
But just this time,

36:27.440 --> 36:28.070
I want you

36:29.710 --> 36:30.400
not to risk your life

36:30.400 --> 36:31.710
for anything.

36:33.960 --> 36:35.290
I need you to stay alive.

36:35.590 --> 36:36.650
Do you understand?

37:07.740 --> 37:10.970
[Chen Mansion]

37:11.320 --> 37:12.160
Zhao.

37:12.590 --> 37:13.360
Jinzhao.

37:14.030 --> 37:14.960
My condolences.

37:17.400 --> 37:19.440
Have the people
from the ancestral home arrived?

37:19.440 --> 37:20.230
Not yet.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.190
Return to Daxin immediately—

37:22.190 --> 37:23.230
ask Grandmother and the others

37:23.230 --> 37:24.150
to come pay their respects.

37:24.150 --> 37:26.080
Make sure Fifth Aunt comes as well.

37:27.070 --> 37:27.660
Okay.

37:27.960 --> 37:28.700
I'll go now.

37:29.760 --> 37:30.290
Let's go.

37:31.360 --> 37:38.070
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

37:37.550 --> 37:38.150
Mother,

37:39.760 --> 37:40.410
Xianlan.

37:41.320 --> 37:43.650
There's something I need to tell you both.

37:44.780 --> 37:47.620
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

37:47.710 --> 37:48.360
Mother.

37:47.730 --> 37:49.790
[Memorial]

37:48.630 --> 37:49.620
Actually...

37:50.840 --> 37:52.440
Third Master is still alive.

37:55.030 --> 37:56.580
What did you say?

37:56.890 --> 37:57.900
Is it true?

37:57.920 --> 37:58.730
Mother.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.500
I owe you an apology.

38:00.840 --> 38:01.920
I should have told you

38:01.920 --> 38:03.250
in advance.

38:03.630 --> 38:05.190
I caused you so much grief.

38:05.930 --> 38:07.230
It's all my fault.

38:07.510 --> 38:08.760
Please forgive me.

38:09.010 --> 38:10.150
[Memorial]

38:10.440 --> 38:11.900
I had suspected it before,

38:12.630 --> 38:13.480
but I thought

38:13.480 --> 38:15.280
it was only my wishful thinking.

38:18.070 --> 38:24.630
[Memorial]

38:19.000 --> 38:19.510
Mother.

38:19.510 --> 38:21.040
Mother.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.140
-Mother.
-Mother.

38:24.000 --> 38:24.550
Mother.

38:24.840 --> 38:25.550
Yanyun is alive.

38:25.550 --> 38:27.150
You should be happy about it.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.290
Mother.

38:29.920 --> 38:32.230
I am happy.

38:33.660 --> 38:36.420
But I can't forgive myself.

38:39.210 --> 38:40.320
Ever since

38:41.330 --> 38:43.970
I thought Yanyun was gone,

38:45.480 --> 38:46.910
every night

38:48.000 --> 38:49.590
when I close my eyes,

38:50.760 --> 38:53.800
I think of him when he was a little boy.

38:55.410 --> 38:57.190
Even as a child he was composed.

38:58.710 --> 39:00.550
Out of all my children,

39:01.440 --> 39:03.370
he was the most well-behaved.

39:03.710 --> 39:06.510
But precisely because
he was so well-behaved,

39:06.670 --> 39:07.730
whenever there was

39:08.760 --> 39:11.040
conflict among the brothers,

39:11.590 --> 39:13.390
no matter who was right or wrong,

39:13.670 --> 39:15.810
I always scolded him first.

39:19.190 --> 39:20.660
But I forgot

39:21.800 --> 39:23.640
that he was only a child too.

39:25.150 --> 39:26.110
Later,

39:26.400 --> 39:27.580
he grew up

39:28.110 --> 39:29.550
and became the most accomplished

39:29.550 --> 39:31.480
of all my sons.

39:32.880 --> 39:34.200
But by then, I felt

39:34.670 --> 39:36.200
he had grown distant from me

39:37.190 --> 39:38.920
and no longer told me anything.

39:40.150 --> 39:41.430
Yet I still expect him

39:41.920 --> 39:43.380
to shoulder every burden.

39:43.960 --> 39:45.210
I expect him

39:46.360 --> 39:48.710
to pave the way for Deyuan's future

39:49.880 --> 39:50.620
and

39:51.480 --> 39:52.740
clean up

39:53.190 --> 39:54.840
Yanwen's messes.

39:56.880 --> 39:58.360
In public,

39:57.770 --> 40:03.350
[Memorial]

39:59.510 --> 40:00.760
he was the son

40:00.920 --> 40:03.440
I proudly showed off to others.

40:05.150 --> 40:06.540
But at home,

40:07.670 --> 40:08.980
I never once

40:09.920 --> 40:13.300
truly praised him.

40:18.190 --> 40:20.150
I was wrong.

40:21.590 --> 40:24.480
I was completely wrong!

40:26.000 --> 40:27.110
All these years,

40:28.150 --> 40:29.950
I've done nothing but wrong him.

40:31.670 --> 40:33.140
If I had another chance,

40:33.630 --> 40:35.760
I would never treat him that way again.

40:36.150 --> 40:37.230
I would...

40:37.440 --> 40:39.840
I would definitely treat him properly.

40:40.760 --> 40:41.510
I know.

40:42.400 --> 40:43.480
I know, Mother.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.690
Third Master is alive and well.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.750
When he comes back,

40:49.280 --> 40:50.590
you can take your time to talk to him.

40:50.590 --> 40:51.360
Alright.

40:52.150 --> 40:52.880
Alright.

40:52.940 --> 40:54.140
Come, help Mother up.

40:54.710 --> 40:55.570
Here, Mother.

41:04.070 --> 41:04.960
Thank you,

41:04.960 --> 41:06.320
my dear child.

41:07.480 --> 41:09.010
This is the least I could do.

41:09.190 --> 41:09.720
Jinzhao,

41:10.920 --> 41:11.440
then,

41:11.800 --> 41:12.800
who exactly

41:12.880 --> 41:14.210
is lying in that coffin?

41:14.960 --> 41:15.510
My Lady.

41:20.550 --> 41:21.590
The Old Madam of the ancestral home

41:21.590 --> 41:23.390
and Fifth Madam Gu have arrived.

41:24.000 --> 41:24.550
Xianlan,

41:25.000 --> 41:25.810
do me a favor.

41:26.150 --> 41:27.480
Take good care of Mother

41:27.800 --> 41:28.800
and Grandmother.

41:29.880 --> 41:30.360
Okay.

41:33.030 --> 41:33.890
Tell Fifth Aunt

41:34.000 --> 41:35.000
to meet me in the study.

41:35.000 --> 41:35.440
Yes.

41:37.670 --> 41:39.080
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

41:58.880 --> 41:59.510
Zhao,

42:00.000 --> 42:01.530
what on earth has happened?

42:01.800 --> 42:02.480
You had Lan

42:02.480 --> 42:04.110
summon me here specifically to mourn—

42:04.110 --> 42:05.190
did something happen

42:05.190 --> 42:06.280
to Xian?

42:08.880 --> 42:09.710
Fifth Aunt.

42:14.710 --> 42:15.480
Ye Xian...

42:18.510 --> 42:19.910
What happened to Ye Xian?

42:21.880 --> 42:23.210
At Huxiao Gorge,

42:27.480 --> 42:29.140
he ran into the Beiman people.

42:30.150 --> 42:30.880
He...

42:35.070 --> 42:36.150
He died?

42:51.840 --> 42:53.130
Before he died,

42:55.370 --> 42:57.100
he told us not to make it public.

42:59.630 --> 43:01.490
He wanted us to continue fighting

43:03.360 --> 43:05.760
the Beiman people
under the Ye Army's name.

43:08.630 --> 43:09.400
So

43:14.510 --> 43:16.680
I could only bring him back in secret.

43:18.880 --> 43:19.840
Where is he?

43:20.280 --> 43:21.190
Where is he?

43:37.510 --> 43:40.920
[A Splendid Match]
